Package: com.wcvoicekeep
Name: wcvoicekeep
Version: 2.0.9
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: 后台保活 (Background Keep). 键盘扩展 wxkb_plugin 始终保活；设置页可勾选任意 App，被杀后事件驱动地在后台无头拉起（不切前台）。每次拉起可记录，记录开关关闭时零写入。Tweaks: wetypekeepalive (SpringBoard, 仅负责弹键盘拉起键盘扩展) + wcvoicekeep daemon (事件驱动看护) + BackgroundKeepPrefs (设置页「后台保活」). Depends: ellekit.
Maintainer: huhansibuxin
Author: huhansibuxin
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit
